{"type":"message","id":"b5fe8215","parentId":"e9ea76ab","timestamp":"2026-02-27T21:00:03.844Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:dc1f52da-a247-4c7c-8ad8-c3f0d5ca71fc daily-update-check] Check for OpenClaw and skills updates using 'openclaw update status' and 'npx skills check'. If updates are available, verify that Telegram channel is synced and notify Sam with the update details.\nCurrent time: Saturday, February 28th, 2026 — 6:00 AM (Asia/Seoul)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1772226003839}}
